# Blucommand

This repository is **Blucommand**. Use these names only:

| Kind | Name |
|------|------|
| Product | Blucommand |
| GitHub / package / CLI | `blucommand` |
| Classes | `BluOSController`, `BluOSCLI` |
| Logger | `blucommand` |
| Env vars | `BLUCOMMAND_DEBUG`, `BLUCOMMAND_STRUCTURED_LOG` |
| Config / logs | `~/.config/blucommand/` |
| Keychain service | `blucommand` |
| Temp discovery files | `.blucommand-tmp-discovery-*` |

Do not introduce other product or package names. The official API PDF host `bluesoundprofessional.com` is an external vendor URL and must stay unchanged.
